{
  "description": "Deterministic navigation scenarios for the Agent OS knowledge architecture. Each scenario names an entry file, the documents that must be reachable by following links or path pointers within a hop budget, phrases the owner document must still carry, and routing-matrix rows that must include or exclude documents. Consumed by scripts/agent-checks/agent-os-doc-navigation-check.py. Paths are relative to the umbrella root. A scenario with optional_entry is reported as unavailable when its product checkout is absent: not evaluated, not counted as passed, and never evidence that the repository is correct. A scenario with advisory reports a present-but-wrong product checkout without failing the umbrella run, and is not counted as passed either.",
  "routing_matrix": "docs/agent-playbooks/doc-routing-and-context-loading.md",
